# Testing Policy
> Standard: Testing workflow

## Intent
States when unit, integration, and e2e tests are required.

## Rule
- Behavior changes should be verified at the most appropriate test level.
- Avoid brittle tests that mirror implementation details too closely.
- Document when coverage is intentionally deferred and why.

